WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
If you've ever felt like there should be a
more comprehensive approach to dental

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.920
care, if you've ever wondered whether your
mouth could reveal important

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:11.060
information about your overall health, or if
you're simply interested in a more

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:15.400
proactive approach to prevention and
longevity, I invite you to experience

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.660
the Forma Method for yourself.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.840
During your visit, we'll perform a
comprehensive evaluation, review our

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:26.300
findings together, and help you better
understand your health, your risks,

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.140
and your opportunities for improvement.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.240
Thank you for spending this time with me.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.680
My team and I look forward to meeting you
and helping you discover what's

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.120
possible through the Forma Method.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.100
Schedule your Forma Method health evaluation
today.